# Terraform state and plans hold secrets (including the SP client secret)
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Real variable values
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.pfx
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig
.kube/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
